{"sha": "39903804cd78b2311a957a8e250d903ff290c13445e1b3bb627ceac484b9c3d6", "body": ["{\\small 左：板式塔。液体流过每块塔板，经降液管流到下方的塔板；", "蒸气向上穿过各块塔板，在液体中鼓泡。冷凝蒸气的一部分", "作为回流返回塔内；塔底的再沸器提供蒸气。右：", "科隆某炼油厂的精馏塔（2014 年），塔内有数十块塔板。（照片：", "CEphoto，Uwe Aranas，CC BY-SA 3.0，", "Wikimedia Commons。）}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\begin{proposition}[费恩斯克]\\label{prop:b2:liquid-vapour-diagrams:fenske}", "在全回流、相对挥发度 $\\alpha$ 为常数时，", "由塔底液体 $x_B$ 到馏出液", "$x_D$ 所需的理论塔板数至少为", "\\[", "  N_{\\min} = \\frac{1}{\\ln\\alpha}\\,\\ln\\!\\left[\\frac{x_D}{1 - x_D}\\cdot\\frac{1 - x_B}{x_B}\\right] .", "\\]", "\\end{proposition}", "", "\\begin{proof}", "自下而上给塔板编号，再沸器为第 1 块板。全回流时，", "第 $k + 1$ 块板上流下的液体，其组成", "与离开第 $k$ 块板的蒸气相同：$x_{k+1} = y_k$。令 $r = x/(1 - x)$，则每块板给出", "$r(y_k) = \\alpha\\,r(x_k)$，于是 $r(x_{k+1}) = \\alpha\\,r(x_k)$，经过 $N$ 块", "板后冷凝蒸气满足 $r(x_D) = \\alpha^N r(x_B)$。取对数，", "便得 $N$。有限回流时，向下流的液体比上升的蒸气更贫，", "每块板的增浓作用更弱，需要更多的塔板。", "\\end{proof}", "", "在 $(x, y)$ 图上，同样的作图是夹在", "平衡曲线与对角线 $y = x$ 之间的阶梯线，每一步", "对应一块理论塔板。", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}", "\\begin{axis}[width=0.55\\linewidth, height=0.55\\linewidth, xmin=0, xmax=1,", "  ymin=0, ymax=1, axis x line=bottom, axis y line=left,", "  xlabel={$x$（苯，液相）}, ylabel={$y$（苯，蒸气）},", "  tick label style={font=\\small}, label style={font=\\small}]", "\\addplot[omThm, thick] table[x=x, y=y] {figdata/out/bachelor-2-liquid-vapour-f-eq.dat};", "\\addplot[black!50] coordinates {(0,0) (1,1)};", "\\addplot[omDef, thick] table[x=x, y=y] {figdata/out/bachelor-2-liquid-vapour-f.dat};", "\\draw[densely dotted] (axis cs:0.95,0) -- (axis cs:0.95,0.95);", "\\draw[densely dotted] (axis cs:0.05,0) -- (axis cs:0.05,0.05);", "\\node[font=\\scriptsize, anchor=south east] at (axis cs:0.945,0.02) {$x_D$};", "\\node[font=\\scriptsize, anchor=south west] at (axis cs:0.05,0.02) {$x_B$};", "\\end{axis}", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small 苯--甲苯体系在全回流下的塔板图，从馏出液组成", "0.95 出发向下：每条水平线段从蒸气连到与之平衡的液体（即一块塔板），", "每条竖直线段从该液体连到下方塔板的蒸气。", "七步即可使液体组成降到 $x_B = 0.05$ 以下；", "由费恩斯克公式得 6.5。}", "% ledger: antoine:benzene.A, antoine:toluene.A (computed in figdata/bachelor-2/liquid-vapour.py)", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\begin{proposition}[精馏塔不能越过共沸物]\\label{prop:b2:liquid-vapour-diagrams:azeotrope-limit}", "对于含共沸物的混合物，若精馏塔的进料位于共沸组成的某一侧，", "则至多能在一端得到共沸物，", "在另一端得到该侧的纯组分。", "\\end{proposition}", "", "\\begin{proof}", "在共沸点处，平衡曲线与对角线相交：$y = x$。在其附近，", "阶梯的每一步都变得无穷小，因此有限块塔板", "都无法到达它，也不能越过它。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{method}[预测分馏结果]\\label{met:b2:liquid-vapour-diagrams:predict-distillation}", "\\begin{enumerate}", "  \\item 在等压相图上，找出进料可达到的最低沸点，即纯组分", "        或正共沸物。它", "        在塔顶馏出。", "  \\item 同侧的最高沸点（纯组分", "        或负共沸物）留在釜中。", "  \\item 若存在共沸物，看进料位于它的哪一侧：只能得到", "        该侧的纯组分。", "  \\item 求塔板数时，用费恩斯克公式或阶梯图，", "        再为实际使用的有限回流增加塔板数。", "\\end{enumerate}", "\\end{method}", "", "对于乙醇和水，进料组成低于 0.881 时，塔顶至多得到", "共沸物，塔底得到水：没有任何精馏塔能得到无水乙醇。", "除去最后百分之几的水，需要另一种方法 --- 例如吸附水的分子筛，", "或加入第三组分以破坏共沸物。", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}[font=\\small, scale=0.95, >={Stealth}]", "  \\pic[transform shape] at (0,0) {heatingmantle};", "  \\pic[transform shape] at (0,0) {rbflask={0.45}{orange!25}};", "  \\foreach \\x/\\y in {-0.35/0.25,0.05/0.18,0.35/0.3}", "    \\fill[black!55] (\\x,\\y) circle (0.06);", "  % Vigreux column from the flask neck (0,3) to (0,6)", "  \\draw[om glass] (-0.22,3.0) -- (-0.22,6.0) (0.22,3.0) -- (0.22,6.0);", "  \\foreach \\yy in {3.4,3.9,4.4,4.9,5.4} {", "    \\draw[om glass] (-0.22,\\yy) -- (-0.06,\\yy+0.18) -- (-0.22,\\yy+0.3);", "    \\draw[om glass] (0.22,\\yy+0.15) -- (0.06,\\yy+0.33) -- (0.22,\\yy+0.45);", "  }", "  \\pic[transform shape] (s) at (0,6.0) {stillhead};", "  \\pic[transform shape] at ($(s-top)+(0,-0.75)$) {thermometer};", "  \\pic[transform shape, rotate=-20] (c) at (s-arm) {liebig={3.4}};", "  % ground-glass joint between the head's side arm and the condenser", "  \\draw[om glass, fill=white, rotate around={-20:(s-arm)}] ($(s-arm)+(-0.12,-0.17)$) rectangle ($(s-arm)+(0.14,0.17)$);", "  \\coordinate (cend) at ($(s-arm)+(-20:3.4)$);", "  \\pic[transform shape] (a) at (cend) {adapter};", "  \\pic[transform shape] at ($(a-tip)+(0,-2.4)$) {erlenmeyer={0.22}{orange!12}};", "  \\draw[<-, omProp, thick] (-0.25,4.6) -- (-1.6,4.6) node[left, text=black,", "    align=right] {维格勒分馏柱\\\\ （凹痕增加接触点）};", "  \\draw[<-, omProp, thick] (0.12,6.72) -- (-1.4,7.4) node[left, text=black,", "    align=right] {温度计球泡\\\\ 与侧管平齐};", "  \\draw[<-, omProp, thick] (1.08,0.3) -- (2.3,-0.2) node[right, text=black]", "    {加热套};", "  \\draw[<-, omProp, thick] ($(a-tip)+(0.75,-2.0)$) -- ++(1.0,0.2)", "    node[right, text=black] {馏出液};", "\\end{tikzpicture}", ""]}